WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.728 --> 00:00:04.895
(gentle piano music)
(birds chirping)

00:00:08.317 --> 00:00:09.585
- [Narrator] They look like something

00:00:09.585 --> 00:00:11.682
out of an Indiana Jones movie,

00:00:11.682 --> 00:00:14.432
Bridges made out of living trees.

00:00:17.959 --> 00:00:22.163
This is Nongriat, a remote
village in Northeastern India

00:00:22.163 --> 00:00:24.580
where locals have been growing bridges

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:26.413
for hundreds of years.

00:00:33.598 --> 00:00:38.294
(speaking in foreign language)

00:00:38.294 --> 00:00:41.076
That's Wiston Miwa, the
head of the village.

00:00:41.076 --> 00:00:44.659
He's lived here his
whole life, since 1952.

00:00:46.129 --> 00:00:50.046
(speaking in foreign language)

00:01:11.601 --> 00:01:14.141
To get the roots to grow
into a bridge across water

00:01:14.141 --> 00:01:18.308
they use wire and old tree
trunks to guide their path.

00:01:19.520 --> 00:01:23.437
(speaking in foreign language)

00:01:33.874 --> 00:01:36.457
(gentle music)

